# Waking the Beast (battlefield.waking_the_beast_cloister_of_tremors, CloisterOfTremors): the exit. The char enters arena 1, then Earth_Protocrystal (arena 1's), in the battlefield:
# 32003 (an optional cutscene, skippable); its update: nothing; finished with 0: not 4: still inside. Again, finished with
# 4: leaveBattlefield(1) (no win, no loss event).
lists CloisterOfTremors/EP_Entrance/onTrigger CloisterOfTremors/Earth_Protocrystal/onTrigger CloisterOfTremors/onEventUpdate/32003 CloisterOfTremors/onEventFinish/32003
char zone=CloisterOfTremors pos=-538.4,0.5,-493.9 job=WAR lvl=75
quest OtherAreas.WakingTheBeast accepted
keyitem RainbowResonator
login
trigger EP_Entrance                     # the resonator: the menu 32000
update 32000 option=49                  # area 1: registered, entered
finish                                  # in the arena
trigger Earth_Protocrystal                  # in the battlefield: 32003
update 32003 option=1                   # onExitEventUpdate: nothing
finish option=0                         # not 4: still inside
trigger Earth_Protocrystal                  # 32003
finish option=4                         # leaveBattlefield(1): out
